---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NewsletterForm from '@/components/NewsletterForm.astro';
import { MARK_PATH, MARK_VIEWBOX } from '@/lib/brand';
import { FOUNDER, SITE } from '@/lib/site';

const roadmap = [
  {
    when: 'Now',
    title: 'Content, tools, and community',
    body: 'Guides and articles, a newsletter, free tools for game night, the Academy, and tabletop training for teams.',
  },
  {
    when: 'Next',
    title: 'The Ludarium Game Lounge, Indianapolis',
    body: 'A membership lounge and community center where every game community meets: clubs, leagues, campaigns, seminars, and anyone who walks in on their own.',
  },
  {
    when: 'Then',
    title: 'A lounge in every city',
    body: 'A network that connects tabletop players everywhere. One membership, every Ludarium, each one shaped by its own city.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="The Ludarium exists for togethering: people coming together to share life, with a game as the reason to gather. Here is what we are building, and why."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About The Ludarium</p>
      <h1>A place for play.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The Ludarium exists for togethering: people coming together to share life, with a game as the
        reason to gather.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight-top">
    <div class="container about-split">
      <div>
        <h2>What is in a name</h2>
        <p>
          <em>Ludus</em> is Latin for play and games. Fittingly, it was also the word for a school.
          <em>-arium</em> means a place for something, as in aquarium and planetarium.
        </p>
        <p>
          Put them together and The Ludarium is simply <strong>a place for play</strong>. A place to
          learn, too.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="about-mark">
        <svg viewBox={MARK_VIEWBOX} aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d={MARK_PATH} />
        </svg>
        <figcaption>Our mark: a game tile with a table for six inside it.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Togethering</p>
      <p class="about-line">{SITE.tagline}</p>
      <p>
        Getting friends together is harder than it should be. A game gives the evening a shape and
        makes it easy to say yes. But nobody remembers the final score a year later. They remember the
        bluff, the comeback, the inside joke that started over a card game and never stopped.
      </p>
      <p>
        The game starts the time together. The people make it worth it. That is togethering, and it is
        everything we build.
      </p>
      <p>
        So we are building more than a game room. A Ludarium is a community center for play: the place
        a city's chess club, its mahjong regulars, its game store's Friday crowd, and its curious
        newcomers all call home. It starts with games. It becomes part of local culture.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <h2>What we are building</h2>
          <p>Step by step, funded by the work before it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ol class="roadmap">
        {
          roadmap.map((step) => (
            <li class="card roadmap__step">
              <p class="eyebrow">{step.when}</p>
              <h3>{step.title}</h3>
              <p>{step.body}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight-top" id="founder" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
    <div class="container founder">
      <figure class="founder__portrait">
        <img
          src={FOUNDER.photo}
          alt="Levi JA Wilson, founder of The Ludarium, in a blue suit with his arms crossed, smiling"
          width="800"
          height="1000"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="founder__text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Who is behind it</p>
        <h2 id="founder-title">{FOUNDER.name}</h2>
        <p class="founder__role">{FOUNDER.role}, The Ludarium. {FOUNDER.city}.</p>
        <p>
          Levi started The Ludarium to build a world he wanted to live in: one where tabletop games
          are about playing them, not owning them. A shelf of games is nice. A table full of people
          playing one is the point.
        </p>
        <p>
          It goes one layer deeper. Even playing is not quite the point. What matters is the time
          itself: people who share your interests, living life together. That is togethering, and it
          is why The Ludarium exists.
        </p>
        <p>
          He is a player first. You will find him at a Magic: The Gathering table with his deck
          sleeved and his playmat out. He built the first tools on this site himself:
          <a href="/game-night-madness/">Game Night Madness</a>, a bracket that settles what to play
          tonight, and the <a href="/rpg-demo-library/">RPG Demo Library</a>, where you can try a
          role-playing game before you buy the book. He also wrote
          <a href="/books/well-burn-that-bridge/"><em>We'll Burn That Bridge When We Get to It</em></a>,
          a field guide to mixed-up sayings, which tells you most of what you need to know about his
          sense of humor.
        </p>
        <p>
          The suit comes out for <a href="/corporate-events/">For Teams</a>, where The Ludarium
          brings leadership and team training to the workplace through tabletop games. Same table,
          different stakes.
        </p>
        <ul class="founder__contact">
          <li><a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${FOUNDER.email}`}>{FOUNDER.email}</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-link" href={FOUNDER.linkedin} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <ul class="founder__moods" aria-label="More photos of Levi">
        <li>
          <figure class="card founder__mood">
            <img
              src="/images/about/levi-at-magicfest.webp"
              alt="Levi grinning at a crowded MagicFest table, his hand resting on a Magic playmat next to a sleeved deck"
              width="720"
              height="871"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>At the table, where he is happiest.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li>
          <figure class="card founder__mood">
            <img
              src="/images/about/levi-on-the-stairs.webp"
              alt="Levi crouched on a wooden staircase, chin on his fist, giving the camera a skeptical look"
              width="720"
              height="870"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Thinking about your next move.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li>
          <figure class="card founder__mood">
            <img
              src="/images/about/levi-in-sunglasses.webp"
              alt="Levi in dark sunglasses and a plaid coat, taking a selfie under green leaves"
              width="400"
              height="300"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption>Off the clock.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight-top section--flush-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-signup">
        <h2>Come play along.</h2>
        <p>Game picks, hosting ideas, and first word on the lounge, in your inbox.</p>
        <NewsletterForm id="about-signup" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-9) var(--space-7);
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: calc(var(--width-content) + 2 * var(--gutter));
  }

  .about-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-split h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }

  .about-split p {
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .about-mark {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-7);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-mark svg {
    width: min(12rem, 60%);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .about-mark figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section--alt {
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
  }

  .section--tight-top {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .section--flush-bottom {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-line {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }

  .roadmap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5);
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .roadmap__step .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .about-signup {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-signup h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }

  .about-signup > p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-signup :global(.signup__note) {
    margin-left: 0;
  }

  .founder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder__portrait {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founder__portrait img,
  .founder__mood img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
  }

  .founder__text h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }

  .founder__role {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-5);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder__text p {
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .founder__contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin: var(--space-5) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder__moods {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin: var(--space-8) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .founder__mood {
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    height: 100%;
  }

  .founder__mood img {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder__mood figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .founder {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .founder__portrait {
      max-width: 22rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 36rem) {
    .founder__moods {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 22rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .about-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
